{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测WindowsExchange工作进程拉起可疑进程。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Microsoft Exchange Worker Spawning Suspicious Processes。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*","winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】WindowsExchange工作进程拉起可疑进程","references":["https://www.microsoft.com/security/blog/2021/03/02/hafnium-targeting-exchange-servers","https://www.volexity.com/blog/2021/03/02/active-exploitation-of-microsoft-exchange-zero-day-vulnerabilities","https://discuss.elastic.co/t/detection-and-response-for-hafnium-activity/266289"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"f81ee52c-297e-46d9-9205-07e66931df26","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  process.parent.name : \"w3wp.exe\" and process.parent.args : \"MSExchange*AppPool\" and\n  (\n    (process.name : (\"cmd.exe\", \"powershell.exe\", \"pwsh.exe\", \"powershell_ise.exe\") or\n    ?process.pe.original_file_name in (\"Cmd.Exe\", \"PowerShell.EXE\", \"pwsh.dll\", \"powershell_ise.EXE\"))\n  )\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsExchange工作进程拉起可疑进程\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1190","name":"Exploit Public-Facing Application","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"},{"id":"T1059.003","name":"Windows Command Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1505","name":"Server Software Component","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1505/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1505.003","name":"Web Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1505/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"version":317,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
